<title>USA: First Pacific names president.</title>
<headline>First Pacific names president.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Pacific Networks Inc said James Hirschy was named president and chief executive officer, as well as a director of the company.</p>
<p>He succeeds M. Peter Thomas, who resigned but will serve the company as a consultant in business development.</p>
<p>Hirschy joined First Pacific in 1994 and has worked in the telecommunications and information systems industries for 30 years.</p>
